t, YouTube, ChatGPT and Gemini endpoints return clean JSON. Batch hundreds of URLs with --input-file, crawl with --save-pattern, schedule with cron. Only use plain HTTP for pure JSON APIs with no scraping defenses.\"", "declared_name": "scrapingbee-cli", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
